      // Enter sends a one-liner, but while a spec is on screen this
      // box is a multi-line editor — there, Enter has to make a
      // newline or the first paragraph break the user types starts a
      // build of a half-edited spec. The Build button still works.
      if (e.key === "Enter" && !e.shiftKey && enhancedFrom === null) {
